# Solo Graffiti: a bailed combo tags nothing. On the low ledge's BS 50-50 the stick is held over until
# the balance goes: a bail, no tag. The next pass grinds it clean and tags it (475). A third, shorter
# grind (ollied off half way, 240) banks less than that best: no re-tag, the best stays 475.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 0 -0.6 0.14 90
cmd 0 run graffiti
hold up 6..100
hold ollie 90..105
tap grind 176
hold right 190..400
bot balance
cmd 600 teleport 0 -0.6 0.14 90
hold up 606..700
hold ollie 690..705
tap grind 776
cmd 1300 teleport 0 -0.6 0.14 90
hold up 1306..1400
hold ollie 1390..1405
tap grind 1476
hold ollie 1540..1560
run 1900
expect event bail{reason=lost balance on the BS 50-50} within 267..267
expect event comboLost within 267..267
expect event tagged{player=1,obstacle=line:11,points=475,from=0} within 1067..1067
expect event comboLanded{name=BS 50-50,points=240} within 1676..1676
expect event tagged count == 1
expect session.owned == 1 at end
expect session.tags.line:11.points == 475 at end
